      "content": "rest sounds good but i dont mean sleeping. i mean just... not having to do this anymore. the performance, the weight, the constant noise in my head. sometimes it feels like the only way to actually get some peace is to just stop existing entirely. like, if there's no me, there's no struggle. does that even make sense?",
